        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 332RE, Tuscan Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Tuscan Door Lever is available in 4 finishes: Florentine Brass, Siena Brass, Etruscan Bronze, and Venetian Nickel. Part of Omnia's Classico Collection, the Tuscan 332RE Lever is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions for 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\" thick doors with either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets. Although ornate, this lever has a rustic feel, the perfect combination of beautiful details and old-world charm.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/sunburst-single-cylinder-deadbolt-omnia-reeddb\">Matching Single Cylinder Deadbolt</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Tuscan Door Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs.</li>\r\n<li>Full lip strike comes standard.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 332RE Tuscan Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>55 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 rosettes, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, slit spindle, and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThe <b>Single Dummy Lever Functions are Handed.</b> <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>. All other Lever functions are Non-Handed.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-DIVA-Specifications.gif?v=1704354622\" width=\"557\" height=\"103\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Classico Collection Finish Options\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Tuscan Door Lever",
                "description": "Omnia 332RE Tuscan Door Lever - The Tuscan Door Lever is available in 4 finishes: Florentine Brass, Siena Brass, Etruscan Bronze, and Venetian Nickel. Part of Omnia's Classico Collection, the Tuscan 332RE Lever is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions for 1-3/8 inch, 1-3/4 inch, 2 inch thick doors with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Although ornate, this lever has a rustic feel, the perfect combination of beautiful details and old-world charm.",
